WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 35=

01:40.780 --> 01:43.020
(Ganlu Hall)

01:50.900 --> 01:51.260
Your Majesty.

01:52.100 --> 01:53.700
You look well today.

01:54.340 --> 01:55.140
Do you...

01:58.100 --> 01:58.540
Do you

01:58.780 --> 02:01.340
want your grandson for company?

02:07.140 --> 02:07.540
No.

02:10.460 --> 02:11.620
Not today.

02:18.860 --> 02:20.100
Bring me the brush and ink.

02:22.380 --> 02:24.180
I'll dictate. You write.

02:26.540 --> 02:30.020
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

02:33.180 --> 02:35.500
I have borne our ancestors' burden

02:35.980 --> 02:38.860
for 41 years.

02:39.460 --> 02:39.980
(Imperial edict of succession!)

02:42.620 --> 02:43.820
There has been much warfare,

02:44.620 --> 02:46.540
yet the realm has grown more peaceful.

02:48.340 --> 02:49.660
Floods and droughts persist,

02:50.180 --> 02:51.580
yet the granaries have not run empty.

02:53.220 --> 02:56.260
All this is thanks to my ministers' aid.

02:57.100 --> 02:58.540
How could my meager virtue

02:59.020 --> 03:00.260
have brought this about?

03:02.420 --> 03:03.660
Crown Prince Mu Xun...

03:06.900 --> 03:07.700
(It's the Crown Prince!)

03:09.900 --> 03:11.180
He is the legitimate heir,

03:11.900 --> 03:13.340
blessed with Heaven-given wisdom.

03:20.740 --> 03:22.100
Why have you stopped writing?

03:23.260 --> 03:23.780
I...

03:24.300 --> 03:25.260
I thought...

03:26.020 --> 03:26.700
Thought what?

03:29.340 --> 03:31.940
You thought I'd name
the Prince of Jin heir?

03:37.060 --> 03:39.340
He's a spineless fool.

03:39.980 --> 03:42.260
He's better off living in comfort.

03:42.860 --> 03:43.740
This throne

03:44.420 --> 03:45.380
is beyond his ability.

03:46.820 --> 03:50.180
I confined the Crown Prince
and cut off his allies

03:50.420 --> 03:51.180
because

03:52.420 --> 03:53.340
all of this

03:54.820 --> 03:56.740
can only be given to him by me.

03:57.220 --> 03:57.940
He himself

03:58.780 --> 04:00.620
must not entertain such ambitions.

04:02.780 --> 04:04.620
He is too calculating.

04:05.020 --> 04:07.940
He needs years of hard lessons.

04:08.180 --> 04:08.860
It will be good for him

04:09.460 --> 04:11.100
and for Huai.

04:12.540 --> 04:14.660
He can't even handle Wanyao.

04:15.100 --> 04:15.620
How can I

04:16.380 --> 04:17.940
possibly feel at ease

04:18.300 --> 04:20.260
entrusting him with the empire?

04:23.660 --> 04:24.580
I understand.

04:25.260 --> 04:26.180
I'll continue writing.

04:28.180 --> 04:31.340
(I mend my faults and grow cautious.
He shall ascend before my coffin.)

04:32.220 --> 04:33.100
(If Mu Xun succeeds to the throne,)

04:34.300 --> 04:35.140
(given his temperament,)

04:35.860 --> 04:37.300
(Prince of Jin, his own brother,)

04:38.100 --> 04:39.100
(may not survive.)

04:41.100 --> 04:42.580
(Chunhua may also...)

04:46.500 --> 04:49.420
(I mend my faults and grow cautious.
He shall ascend before my coffin.)

05:00.140 --> 05:02.980
(Follow Han Emperor Wen's funeral rites.
I entrust the realm to you.)

05:02.980 --> 05:03.580
Bring it here.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.700
(Follow Han Emperor Wen's funeral rites.
I entrust the realm to you.)

05:27.700 --> 05:28.540
Put it away.

05:33.740 --> 05:34.580
This must not be disclosed.

05:36.660 --> 05:37.140
Yes.

06:07.740 --> 06:08.540
(He's fine now.)

06:17.060 --> 06:17.580
Miss?

06:18.180 --> 06:19.180
Why are you standing at the door?

06:28.220 --> 06:30.620
Sir, your fever was awful yesterday.

06:31.260 --> 06:33.300
Thankfully, it soon passed.

06:33.740 --> 06:35.300
Perhaps the heavy rain all night

06:35.420 --> 06:36.660
washed away your illness too.

06:39.380 --> 06:39.940
Perhaps.

06:40.860 --> 06:42.740
The clerk asked me to bring these over.

06:43.260 --> 06:44.460
But he said there's no rush.

06:44.940 --> 06:46.220
Wait until you've fully recovered.

06:47.780 --> 06:48.820
I'm well enough now.

06:49.500 --> 06:50.300
Read them to me.

06:54.340 --> 06:55.100
But

06:55.340 --> 06:57.900
Mr. Yang's maid brought medicine.

06:58.540 --> 06:59.740
Why don't you drink it first?

07:08.940 --> 07:09.340
All right.

07:10.860 --> 07:11.660
Thank you, Miss.

07:23.900 --> 07:25.980
Oh no. I brought the wrong things.

07:26.220 --> 07:27.020
This isn't the right pile.

07:27.540 --> 07:28.300
Sir, I'm sorry.

07:28.540 --> 07:29.260
I'll be right back.

07:29.900 --> 07:31.980
Miss, please watch over him.

08:05.500 --> 08:07.180
Your Highness now bears the fate
of the realm.

08:08.740 --> 08:09.980
A small county like Lanyang

08:11.620 --> 08:12.900
isn't worth staying for so long.

08:44.620 --> 08:45.540
When did you find out?

08:48.580 --> 08:49.140
Was it that night?

08:50.460 --> 08:51.860
When I wrote on your palm?

08:52.740 --> 08:53.300
That night,

08:54.540 --> 08:55.660
I was certain it was you.

08:57.340 --> 08:58.380
Before that, I only suspected.

08:59.300 --> 09:00.380
Then why didn't you say so sooner?

09:06.140 --> 09:06.820
Why so silent?

09:09.220 --> 09:09.900
Scholar Yan,

09:11.060 --> 09:12.580
aren't you usually so eloquent?

09:29.620 --> 09:30.420
I thought

09:32.740 --> 09:33.980
we would never meet again.

09:39.980 --> 09:41.220
That you were still willing to see me

09:44.660 --> 09:45.500
makes me very happy.

09:46.140 --> 09:46.940
Happy?

09:51.460 --> 09:52.860
Happy that you fooled me once again,

09:54.540 --> 09:55.460
or do you have some other motive?

09:57.420 --> 09:58.100
You knew

09:58.980 --> 09:59.860
once the truth came out,

10:01.380 --> 10:02.300
I would leave at once,

10:03.420 --> 10:03.740
didn't you?

10:07.180 --> 10:08.380
Back in Lingnan,

10:09.380 --> 10:10.820
you had me completely fooled

10:12.020 --> 10:13.420
just to make me take you away.

10:15.820 --> 10:16.300
This time,

10:17.340 --> 10:18.060
what do you want?

10:19.940 --> 10:21.180
Now that you've lost your sight...

10:26.220 --> 10:27.380
Your blindness is what you deserve.

10:28.260 --> 10:28.980
I hope one day

10:29.860 --> 10:31.180
that wretched tongue of yours

10:31.460 --> 10:32.380
will be of no use either.

10:44.420 --> 10:45.020
(Shendu Hall)
Then...

10:47.900 --> 10:48.980
When will you leave?

10:56.020 --> 10:56.540
Today.

11:25.820 --> 11:26.500
Prepare to depart.

11:28.660 --> 11:29.780
Must you rush so much?

11:44.820 --> 11:45.420
It's time to go.

11:46.340 --> 11:47.020
Is it because

11:47.500 --> 11:48.780
there's no reason to stay here anymore,

11:49.740 --> 11:50.420
or because

11:51.180 --> 11:52.620
Yan Shang finally knows who you are?

11:53.060 --> 11:53.700
You've overstepped!

11:58.180 --> 11:58.780
It's time to go.

12:01.260 --> 12:02.940
(While I can still be ruthless.)

12:21.740 --> 12:28.220
(County Office)

12:28.220 --> 12:28.780
Leaving already?

12:29.700 --> 12:30.380
Here, take this.

12:30.660 --> 12:31.340
I'll go help.

12:31.500 --> 12:31.820
All right.

12:33.620 --> 12:35.660
Miss, sir,
are you friends of our magistrate?

12:37.100 --> 12:37.620
Yes.

12:39.060 --> 12:40.740
Come back to Lanyang when you can

12:41.020 --> 12:42.300
and visit our magistrate.

12:44.140 --> 12:46.180
(County Office)

12:46.180 --> 12:47.060
The magistrate is here.

12:54.980 --> 12:55.540
Magistrate Yan.

13:07.260 --> 13:07.940
What are you doing here?

13:08.500 --> 13:13.380
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

13:13.700 --> 13:14.140
Farewell,

13:15.020 --> 13:16.980
Your Highnesses.

13:18.940 --> 13:19.500
There's no need.

13:20.140 --> 13:21.260
You weren't here to see me off anyway.

13:24.860 --> 13:25.220
Wanyao.

13:25.220 --> 13:29.100
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

13:29.220 --> 13:34.940
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪
(County Office)

13:38.780 --> 13:39.180
Yan Shang.

13:41.060 --> 13:42.420
In Huai, officials are chosen

13:44.420 --> 13:45.380
by looks, speech, calligraphy,
and judgment,

13:46.060 --> 13:46.860
with appearance ranked first.

13:48.100 --> 13:48.980
Since you are now blind,

13:50.140 --> 13:51.460
you should be removed as magistrate.

13:53.380 --> 13:54.380
But your record is commendable.

13:56.060 --> 13:57.980
I can make an exception for you.

14:00.580 --> 14:01.740
Thank you for your grace, Your Highness.

14:01.740 --> 14:04.500
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪
(County Office)

14:04.780 --> 14:09.220
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

14:09.220 --> 14:10.020
Go back to your duties.

14:10.020 --> 14:11.420
♪Not a single hour less♪

14:11.860 --> 14:12.460
In a few days,

14:13.660 --> 14:14.500
I'll send an imperial physician.

14:15.060 --> 14:15.820
There's no need, Your Highness.

14:16.100 --> 14:17.380
How dare you refuse me?

14:19.220 --> 14:22.660
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

14:22.820 --> 14:25.380
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

14:25.380 --> 14:26.020
I wouldn't dare.

14:27.100 --> 14:27.620
It's just that

14:28.460 --> 14:29.940
Wenji sent imperial physicians
several times.

14:31.260 --> 14:31.860
It's no use.

14:32.180 --> 14:33.180
The ones he found didn't work.

14:33.860 --> 14:35.300
I may yet find someone
who can treat you!

14:35.460 --> 14:38.100
♪- Dusk lights fade, flowers bloom;
- May time be free of pain♪

14:38.580 --> 14:39.060
What are you laughing at?

14:39.060 --> 14:40.700
♪You're the only one I need♪

14:40.940 --> 14:41.820
I'm laughing at myself.

14:43.140 --> 14:45.500
Your Highness stayed silent for days,

14:46.420 --> 14:46.980
and the moment you spoke,

14:48.060 --> 14:48.980
all you did was scold me.

14:49.220 --> 14:49.860
You deserve it!

14:49.860 --> 14:51.340
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

14:51.380 --> 14:54.820
♪My last untouched innocence♪

15:00.180 --> 15:00.980
When we parted that day,

15:02.300 --> 15:04.780
I never dared hope we would meet again.

15:06.260 --> 15:06.700
And yet,

15:08.020 --> 15:08.700
in this life,

15:10.020 --> 15:10.980
we must part once more.

15:13.220 --> 15:15.060
A long road lies ahead.

15:15.700 --> 15:16.700
We may never meet again.

15:19.620 --> 15:20.580
I only wish you

15:21.820 --> 15:22.980
health and peace, year after year,

15:23.900 --> 15:24.980
and a long, blessed life.

15:26.900 --> 15:32.780
♪- Burning bright as a song;
- See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

15:32.900 --> 15:37.780
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

15:37.860 --> 15:42.660
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

15:42.740 --> 15:44.540
♪Not a single hour less♪

15:44.580 --> 15:48.360
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

15:48.360 --> 15:52.340
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

15:52.420 --> 15:55.780
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

15:56.060 --> 15:59.420
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

15:59.620 --> 16:06.500
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

16:06.700 --> 16:08.580
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

16:08.580 --> 16:11.220
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

16:11.260 --> 16:13.780
♪You're the only one I need♪

16:13.860 --> 16:17.520
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

16:17.520 --> 16:21.020
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

16:21.100 --> 16:24.420
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

16:24.580 --> 16:27.940
♪My last untouched innocence♪

16:28.260 --> 16:31.700
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

16:31.980 --> 16:35.340
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

16:35.500 --> 16:42.380
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

16:42.580 --> 16:44.460
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

16:44.460 --> 16:47.100
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

16:47.220 --> 16:49.780
♪You're the only one I need♪

16:49.820 --> 16:52.580
♪By your side, through joy and pain♪

16:52.580 --> 16:56.980
♪Is that eternity?♪
(Chengfu Gate)

16:57.060 --> 17:00.420
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

17:00.460 --> 17:03.900
♪The wind blows past us♪

17:04.180 --> 17:08.780
♪- If there's still;
- Some warmth left in this world♪

17:09.540 --> 17:14.020
♪You're the only one I need♪

17:16.380 --> 17:16.900
Yang Si.

17:19.740 --> 17:21.380
Thanks for staying these past few days.

17:24.180 --> 17:25.100
No need to thank me.

17:25.820 --> 17:26.580
It wasn't exactly my pleasure.

17:30.820 --> 17:32.100
Then thank you for your patience.

17:38.060 --> 17:38.500
Forget it.

17:40.020 --> 17:41.820
He was fine before. Look at him now.

17:43.060 --> 17:43.820
Anyone would feel sorry for him...

17:46.020 --> 17:47.140
Why should I hold it against him?

17:55.900 --> 17:57.320
(I'm ignorant and know little,
yet I've studied how rulers govern.)

17:57.320 --> 17:58.620
(The principles are all laid out.
None in history rivals your foresight.)

18:18.860 --> 18:20.890
(Thus, humbly, I offer my limited
thoughts and observations.)

18:20.890 --> 18:22.780
(Though unworthy of Your Majesty's
grace, I submit what may be of value.)

18:30.500 --> 18:31.300
Once we're back in Sheng'an,

18:32.020 --> 18:33.620
we'll seek a renowned eye doctor.

18:34.220 --> 18:35.100
There may yet be a way.

19:14.140 --> 19:14.620
Easy.

19:15.180 --> 19:15.900
Don't splash them.

19:16.260 --> 19:16.620
Yes.

19:31.020 --> 19:31.460
Mother!

19:31.820 --> 19:32.220
Mother!

19:32.620 --> 19:33.020
Mother!

19:33.940 --> 19:34.420
Stop the carriage!

19:40.900 --> 19:41.340
Doctor!

19:41.740 --> 19:42.060
Quick!

19:42.540 --> 19:42.940
Doctor!

19:43.620 --> 19:43.900
Here!

19:44.220 --> 19:44.660
Lay her down here.

19:50.020 --> 19:50.500
Mother.

20:11.300 --> 20:11.940
Thank you, Doctor!

20:12.260 --> 20:12.980
Thank you, Doctor!

20:13.260 --> 20:13.980
- Please, get up.
- Thank you.

20:14.100 --> 20:15.060
A miracle worker!

20:19.860 --> 20:20.300
Mother.

20:21.340 --> 20:21.700
Mother.

20:26.500 --> 20:27.380
Sir, may I ask

20:28.340 --> 20:29.940
what this elderly woman's illness is?

20:30.460 --> 20:31.180
It's not an illness.

20:31.700 --> 20:32.900
The weather has been
suddenly hot and cold lately.

20:33.380 --> 20:34.540
She was likely caught in the rain

20:34.780 --> 20:35.660
and has overexerted herself.

20:36.060 --> 20:36.780
Her breath has become disordered,

20:37.300 --> 20:38.740
and Yin and Yang no longer harmonize.

20:39.020 --> 20:40.060
That's what caused her fainting spell.

20:40.700 --> 20:41.580
Lately,

20:42.260 --> 20:43.660
I've seen many patients like this.

20:44.460 --> 20:44.740
Yes.

20:44.900 --> 20:45.180
That's right.

20:46.060 --> 20:46.820
She was indeed caught in the rain.

20:47.660 --> 20:48.180
Thank you, Doctor.

20:48.500 --> 20:49.060
There's no need to worry.

20:49.460 --> 20:50.540
She just needs to rest at home.

20:51.020 --> 20:51.300
All right.

20:51.620 --> 20:52.140
Dear!

20:53.420 --> 20:55.140
Our stored herbs are nearly gone.

20:56.540 --> 20:59.460
Let's buy more herbs in town soon.

21:00.220 --> 21:00.820
Get some rest.

21:00.980 --> 21:01.660
I'll go tomorrow.

21:06.860 --> 21:07.980
You heal the sick, give out medicine,

21:08.740 --> 21:09.620
and help the poor.

21:09.620 --> 21:10.300
That's truly admirable.

21:11.140 --> 21:12.020
May I ask your names?

21:12.220 --> 21:12.620
You're too kind.

21:12.620 --> 21:13.900
(Lin Dao, son of Prefect Lin Chuan;
Liu Ruozhu, Chancellor Liu's daughter)

21:13.900 --> 21:14.540
I'm Lin Dao.

21:15.620 --> 21:16.220
My wife is surnamed Liu.

21:18.700 --> 21:19.220
Lin Dao?

21:21.100 --> 21:22.940
Is Yuezhou Prefect Lin Chuan
your father?

21:23.220 --> 21:23.660
Yes.

21:24.620 --> 21:25.580
How did you know, Miss?

21:27.900 --> 21:28.700
This lady

21:29.140 --> 21:30.300
must be Chancellor Liu's daughter.

21:37.860 --> 21:39.060
I failed to recognize Your Highness.

21:39.620 --> 21:40.340
I was discourteous just now.

21:41.620 --> 21:42.740
Her Highness is traveling incognito.

21:43.340 --> 21:44.740
Please don't reveal her identity, sir.

21:45.700 --> 21:46.060
Please, sit.

21:46.820 --> 21:47.260
I understand.

21:47.820 --> 21:48.540
Rest assured.

21:49.740 --> 21:50.020
Sit.

21:54.900 --> 21:56.140
I've heard that Chancellor Liu

21:56.580 --> 21:57.700
considered Sheng'an's finest young men.

21:58.300 --> 22:00.900
In the end, Ms. Liu chose Mr. Lin

22:01.340 --> 22:02.180
as her husband.

22:03.180 --> 22:03.980
Seeing you today,

22:04.500 --> 22:05.380
I can say Chancellor Liu chose well.

22:06.300 --> 22:07.340
I'm fortunate that my wife accepted me.

22:08.420 --> 22:10.580
The Lin family has many officials,

22:11.460 --> 22:13.380
and their Tianshui Library
holds many books,

22:13.660 --> 22:14.500
making it renowned among scholars.

22:15.100 --> 22:16.780
You, too, are known for your talent.

22:17.740 --> 22:19.980
Why not take the exams and serve?

22:20.460 --> 22:21.340
Life is brief,

22:21.540 --> 22:22.340
and everyone has their own aspirations.

22:23.220 --> 22:24.340
The Lin clan has many sons.

22:24.780 --> 22:25.860
It doesn't need me
to enter civil service.

22:26.420 --> 22:28.060
Your Highness is promoting the exams.

22:28.420 --> 22:30.700
Scholars abound across the realm.

22:31.260 --> 22:31.700
Huai

22:32.220 --> 22:33.780
has enough scholars already.

22:34.780 --> 22:36.860
I've never met a noble-born man

22:37.500 --> 22:38.460
whose ambition was to practice medicine.

22:40.580 --> 22:41.260
To be honest, Your Highness,

22:42.460 --> 22:43.740
I loved reading as a child,

22:44.220 --> 22:45.620
but I mostly read history and classics.

22:45.740 --> 22:46.500
I paid little heed to worldly affairs.

22:47.100 --> 22:47.620
Later,

22:48.300 --> 22:49.500
I traveled far and wide with my books.

22:50.100 --> 22:52.340
I saw what happened to local families.

22:53.100 --> 22:54.660
If one falls seriously ill,

22:56.220 --> 22:57.540
the family often spend all they have,

22:57.780 --> 22:59.060
yet still lose their loved one.

22:59.620 --> 23:00.380
That's when I realized

23:01.020 --> 23:01.900
though a physician holds a humble rank,

23:02.500 --> 23:03.340
they can save lives.

23:03.980 --> 23:05.420
Our home has thousands of books,

23:05.780 --> 23:07.100
but only the healing arts

23:07.660 --> 23:09.340
can ease the people's suffering.

23:13.140 --> 23:14.380
You are fortunate to have a wife

23:14.660 --> 23:16.380
who'll travel with you through hardship,
treating patients wherever you go.

23:17.340 --> 23:18.300
Is that

23:18.780 --> 23:19.940
your passion too, Ms. Liu?

23:20.780 --> 23:21.860
I enjoy collecting old books,

23:22.460 --> 23:24.380
especially books on music and Go.

23:25.340 --> 23:26.260
I travel with my husband,

23:26.860 --> 23:27.740
helping him treat patients,

23:28.260 --> 23:29.580
and he searches for old books for me

23:30.260 --> 23:31.100
without sparing himself any effort.

23:31.940 --> 23:32.980
Unfortunately,

23:33.620 --> 23:34.620
I cannot see.

23:35.460 --> 23:36.500
Otherwise, along the way,

23:37.180 --> 23:38.700
I could help you with so much more.

23:39.380 --> 23:40.420
Ms. Liu, your eyes...

23:42.540 --> 23:43.580
With Lin Dao's medical skills,

23:44.380 --> 23:45.380
there's still nothing he can do?

23:47.300 --> 23:48.420
He's done all he can.

23:49.460 --> 23:52.260
But I've been this way since birth.

23:53.180 --> 23:54.900
My father sought renowned physicians

23:55.220 --> 23:56.100
but nothing helped.

23:56.660 --> 23:57.260
My husband

23:57.900 --> 23:59.660
had read every medical book
in Tianshui Library.

24:00.580 --> 24:02.660
We've traveled far and wide,

24:03.220 --> 24:04.660
seeking remedies across the land.

24:05.420 --> 24:06.100
Sadly,

24:07.060 --> 24:08.140
none has worked.

24:09.180 --> 24:10.220
This congenital blindness

24:12.060 --> 24:13.500
is indeed beyond the reach of medicine.

24:18.700 --> 24:19.260
Last year,

24:20.180 --> 24:20.900
while staying in the Shu region,

24:22.220 --> 24:24.260
I treated two patients
who had been blind for a long time.

24:25.260 --> 24:27.460
They regained their sight
after acupuncture.

24:28.940 --> 24:29.460
Unfortunately,

24:31.220 --> 24:33.900
the same technique did not suit my wife.

24:35.300 --> 24:36.980
I only made you suffer needlessly.

24:37.300 --> 24:38.060
Don't worry.

24:41.460 --> 24:42.060
Mr. Lin,

24:44.180 --> 24:45.060
I'd like you

24:45.820 --> 24:46.660
to see a patient.

24:55.340 --> 24:55.780
Coming.

25:12.860 --> 25:13.500
Who's outside?

25:15.220 --> 25:16.140
Your eyes can't see,

25:16.620 --> 25:17.500
yet you'll open the door to anyone?

25:18.260 --> 25:19.540
Have you no sense of caution?

25:21.780 --> 25:22.700
Donglang was fast asleep.

25:25.060 --> 25:25.540
Why are you...

25:35.780 --> 25:39.460
(Shendu Hall)

25:39.460 --> 25:40.380
From what I can tell,

25:41.500 --> 25:43.260
his blindness is from poison.

25:43.460 --> 25:44.300
It blocks the eye channels.

25:45.140 --> 25:46.740
First, needle the point,

25:47.220 --> 25:49.060
then shield his eyes with healing gauze.

25:49.740 --> 25:51.500
His sight may return. There's hope.

25:52.580 --> 25:53.740
But this method of acupuncture

25:56.220 --> 25:57.420
may cause him some pain.

25:58.140 --> 25:59.180
What are the chances of success?

26:02.940 --> 26:03.420
Thirty percent.

26:05.260 --> 26:07.060
Even ten percent would be worth trying.

26:08.580 --> 26:08.900
Please.

26:12.740 --> 26:13.980
Your Highness decided for me

26:14.660 --> 26:15.900
as if these were your own eyes.

26:16.100 --> 26:16.620
They are mine!

26:17.220 --> 26:18.460
Even your life is mine! Remember that!

26:25.260 --> 26:29.500
(Shendu Hall)

26:53.980 --> 26:54.540
Dr. Lin.

27:04.340 --> 27:04.780
Yan Shang!

27:11.220 --> 27:11.820
It's all right.

27:12.980 --> 27:13.460
That's it.

27:23.020 --> 27:23.780
How do you feel?

27:33.980 --> 27:35.020
Can't you see even a glimmer?

27:36.740 --> 27:37.220
No.

27:44.180 --> 27:44.660
I'm sorry.

27:45.260 --> 27:46.100
It seems this treatment

27:47.740 --> 27:48.780
isn't right for you either.

27:51.980 --> 27:52.460
Don't take it off.

27:54.860 --> 27:55.340
Your Highness.

28:01.060 --> 28:01.900
Thank you for your efforts, Dr. Lin.

28:02.980 --> 28:03.780
I appreciate

28:04.740 --> 28:05.660
your kindness.

28:06.460 --> 28:07.500
I'll keep searching.

28:08.420 --> 28:09.620
I believe there's a cure.

28:11.140 --> 28:11.620
Mr. Yan,

28:12.300 --> 28:13.100
sorry to disturb you so late.

28:14.340 --> 28:14.780
We'll take our leave.

28:15.140 --> 28:15.580
(Shendu Hall)
Wait.

28:16.380 --> 28:17.460
Dr. Lin, you've traveled for days.

28:18.340 --> 28:19.060
Why not

28:19.500 --> 28:20.500
stay here tonight with your wife?

29:04.340 --> 29:05.140
Why don't you light the lamp?

29:06.100 --> 29:07.060
The lamp oil

29:07.740 --> 29:09.180
is where I can save.

29:09.540 --> 29:10.220
But I don't like this!

29:31.140 --> 29:32.180
I hate seeing you

29:33.660 --> 29:35.220
grope through life in the dark.

29:37.980 --> 29:38.460
Your Highness.

29:39.700 --> 29:41.180
I've grown used to it.

29:42.220 --> 29:43.100
In my daily life,

29:43.860 --> 29:44.900
it causes me little trouble.

29:45.580 --> 29:47.300
Not a word you say pleases me.

29:48.500 --> 29:50.300
Not like when you wooed me, Yan Shang.

29:52.980 --> 29:54.060
If that's all you have to say,

29:54.460 --> 29:55.100
then don't say it.

29:57.820 --> 29:59.140
I was doing it on purpose, actually.

30:03.060 --> 30:04.140
I let the brush slip on purpose.

30:12.140 --> 30:12.820
The truth is,

30:14.260 --> 30:15.900
I knew you shouldn't come back.

30:17.140 --> 30:18.140
But you did.

30:19.580 --> 30:20.940
And I'm overjoyed.

30:23.100 --> 30:24.260
When I woke this morning,

30:25.660 --> 30:26.540
your hair

30:27.460 --> 30:28.500
brushed against my face.

30:30.220 --> 30:31.460
I was filled with joy.

30:38.220 --> 30:38.940
The truth is...

30:41.580 --> 30:42.460
I'm scared.

30:43.660 --> 30:44.580
Because even in my dreams,

30:45.900 --> 30:46.540
your face

30:48.260 --> 30:49.540
is starting to fade.

30:51.460 --> 30:52.060
If...

30:53.660 --> 30:54.780
I could see you once more,

30:56.740 --> 30:57.820
I'd remember it all.

30:58.980 --> 31:00.380
Every detail of your face.

31:02.100 --> 31:02.620
If...

32:15.580 --> 32:17.300
If only I'd met Lin Dao sooner,

32:18.260 --> 32:18.860
that would've been better.

32:22.060 --> 32:23.940
He may not have cured your eyes,

32:24.980 --> 32:26.220
but he cured your tongue.

32:49.140 --> 32:54.860
(County Office)

32:55.420 --> 32:55.820
Mr. Yan.

32:56.540 --> 32:56.940
We'll take our leave.

32:59.740 --> 33:00.980
Dr. Lin, Ms. Liu,

33:01.780 --> 33:03.180
if you ever pass through Lanyang again,

33:03.620 --> 33:05.220
please do visit my home.

33:08.220 --> 33:09.420
Thank you for the kind invitation.

33:09.940 --> 33:10.700
But

33:10.980 --> 33:13.460
we'll visit an old friend in Youzhou,

33:14.060 --> 33:16.620
then head south to seek ancient books

33:16.820 --> 33:17.660
and treat patients along the way.

33:18.700 --> 33:19.100
Yes.

33:19.700 --> 33:20.980
We don't know when we'll return.

33:23.300 --> 33:24.820
To have each other wherever you roam,

33:26.060 --> 33:27.100
you needn't envy any other couple.

33:28.580 --> 33:29.540
Your Highness
and the Prince Consort, too...

33:38.100 --> 33:39.700
Your Highness, gentlemen,

33:40.660 --> 33:41.580
until we meet again.

33:43.980 --> 33:45.140
Until we meet again.

33:45.140 --> 33:46.100
(County Office)

33:46.100 --> 33:46.460
Dear.

33:47.140 --> 33:47.500
Let's go.

33:57.140 --> 34:00.460
(Chengfu Gate)

34:00.460 --> 34:04.180
(County Office)

34:04.180 --> 34:05.540
You've gone to great trouble for me.

34:05.820 --> 34:06.860
I have no way to repay you.

34:08.100 --> 34:11.140
The Ghost Festival is on in town today.

34:11.500 --> 34:11.860
I wonder if you two...

34:11.860 --> 34:12.420
I'll pass.

34:13.740 --> 34:15.020
Where's a good tavern in Lanyang?

34:15.460 --> 34:16.060
I'd like a drink or two.

34:17.540 --> 34:18.060
Yang Si.

34:18.260 --> 34:18.620
What?

34:19.220 --> 34:21.260
Do you want to drink me under the table?

34:24.660 --> 34:24.980
Donglang.

34:25.180 --> 34:26.220
He can't drink.

34:26.540 --> 34:27.540
I'll take you to a good tavern.

34:28.100 --> 34:28.420
Come on.

34:28.980 --> 34:29.340
Let's go.

34:30.060 --> 34:30.340
Go.

34:30.340 --> 34:32.380
(County Office)

34:35.140 --> 34:35.700
Go on.

34:36.500 --> 34:37.420
What about the Ghost Festival?

34:38.500 --> 34:39.460
The Ghost Festival in Lanyang...

34:41.620 --> 34:42.060
Are you okay?

34:50.740 --> 34:51.460
There's nothing serious.

34:52.300 --> 34:54.300
I just had a sudden headache.

34:54.820 --> 34:55.460
It's gone now.

34:58.300 --> 35:00.020
Did Dr. Lin botch the treatment?

35:02.580 --> 35:04.220
We should have kept him here longer,

35:05.300 --> 35:06.500
so he could try a few more methods

35:07.060 --> 35:07.780
and put you through more suffering.

35:11.020 --> 35:13.020
Then I'll go bring him back.

35:14.060 --> 35:14.660
Come back.

35:16.020 --> 35:18.060
Drive evil spirits away! Light the way!

35:18.900 --> 35:22.420
Come see our latest scented sachets!

35:30.060 --> 35:31.820
Sugar figurines! Come buy!

35:32.700 --> 35:33.860
Sugar figurines!

35:43.420 --> 35:43.860
Magistrate Yan!

35:43.860 --> 35:44.700
Come again if you like them!

35:45.500 --> 35:46.300
I'll take these two.

35:46.300 --> 35:47.580
Scented sachets!

35:48.580 --> 35:50.660
Freshly made sachets! Have a look!

35:50.660 --> 35:52.420
Magistrate Yan, out for the festival?

35:52.940 --> 35:53.620
Magistrate Yan.

35:54.140 --> 35:55.740
Who's this lady beside you?

35:55.820 --> 35:56.820
She's quite beautiful!

35:58.620 --> 36:00.260
Here, take this lantern.

36:05.060 --> 36:05.460
Thank you.

36:06.460 --> 36:06.860
Thank you.

36:07.820 --> 36:08.100
Let's go.

36:08.140 --> 36:08.460
Come on.

36:11.580 --> 36:14.780
Drive evil spirits away! Light the way!

36:14.820 --> 36:15.700
On your right,

36:16.020 --> 36:18.740
there are little potted fruit trees.

36:19.540 --> 36:22.100
They're made of bamboo strips
and colored paper.

36:23.020 --> 36:24.580
Lanterns made from mugwort stalks!

36:28.700 --> 36:29.380
It's a shadow-puppet show.

36:31.620 --> 36:32.060
Yes.

36:32.340 --> 36:32.740
Hit him!

36:33.060 --> 36:33.860
Well done!

36:33.860 --> 36:34.300
Wonderful!

36:34.580 --> 36:34.980
Wonderful!

36:34.980 --> 36:36.060
We never tire of watching this!

36:40.100 --> 36:41.540
Lanyang's lanterns are fascinating.

36:42.460 --> 36:43.740
I've never seen these in Sheng'an.

36:45.220 --> 36:46.140
What do they look like?

36:47.740 --> 36:48.620
Like stars,

36:49.140 --> 36:49.980
twinkling in the night.

36:51.260 --> 36:52.180
They must be beautiful.

36:57.300 --> 36:58.140
It's lively up ahead.

36:58.900 --> 37:00.140
A rite for wandering spirits, it seems.

37:01.420 --> 37:01.980
Let's go take a look.

37:09.620 --> 37:10.380
Beautiful!

37:10.820 --> 37:11.860
It's so beautiful!

37:13.460 --> 37:14.300
(Chengfu Gate)
Wonderful!

37:15.380 --> 37:15.900
One more!

37:16.300 --> 37:17.420
Wonderful!

37:18.740 --> 37:19.300
Beautiful!

37:19.300 --> 37:20.380
One more!

37:21.220 --> 37:22.780
One more!

37:23.260 --> 37:23.860
Beautiful!

37:26.260 --> 37:27.580
Wonderful!

37:28.340 --> 37:29.180
One more!

37:29.380 --> 37:30.140
Another one!

37:30.540 --> 37:31.500
That's gorgeous!

37:32.700 --> 37:36.540
Wonderful! Wonderful!

37:37.500 --> 37:38.140
So beautiful!

37:41.260 --> 37:42.020
One more!

37:44.900 --> 37:45.620
This is fascinating.

37:46.500 --> 37:47.500
The living share a lively celebration,

37:48.300 --> 37:49.740
yet it's all to comfort the departed

37:50.100 --> 37:50.940
and guide the spirits to rest.

37:52.140 --> 37:52.540
Yan Shang.

37:53.300 --> 37:54.620
Have you thought about life and death?

37:56.260 --> 37:57.300
I did when I was young.

37:57.860 --> 37:59.700
I hoped my loved ones watched over me,

38:00.180 --> 38:01.420
yet feared they might never find peace.

38:02.780 --> 38:03.660
I no longer think about it.

38:04.380 --> 38:05.500
Life lasts no more than 30,000 days.

38:06.300 --> 38:08.380
We start naive, end frail and confused,

38:08.980 --> 38:09.940
and face danger, worry, and illness.

38:11.100 --> 38:12.140
The time we have to accomplish anything

38:12.620 --> 38:13.620
amounts to only a few decades.

38:14.620 --> 38:15.220
Every day we live

38:15.860 --> 38:16.940
must be spent on something worthwhile.

38:17.620 --> 38:18.660
Doesn't living like that wear you out?

38:19.900 --> 38:20.780
The world is but a waystation,

38:21.060 --> 38:21.860
and all things share one home.

38:22.740 --> 38:24.420
In the end, everything turns to dust.

38:25.420 --> 38:27.580
So we should live freely and fully
while we can

38:28.540 --> 38:29.300
and achieve what we set our minds to.

38:30.020 --> 38:30.620
Once we're dead,

38:31.060 --> 38:32.180
there'll be no chance to do anything.

38:33.140 --> 38:34.180
What is it Your Highness wants?

38:34.980 --> 38:35.900
There is much I want.

38:36.620 --> 38:37.660
So no matter what,

38:37.940 --> 38:39.020
I must live well

38:39.580 --> 38:40.500
and pursue all that I seek.

38:43.660 --> 38:44.580
Then I wish Your Highness

38:45.380 --> 38:46.340
every success.

38:47.500 --> 38:49.580
Then I thank you for those kind words.

38:54.980 --> 38:55.540
Who is she?

38:55.660 --> 38:56.020
Who is it?

38:56.020 --> 38:56.340
Who?

38:56.700 --> 38:57.060
Who is it?

38:57.180 --> 38:57.740
Who is she?

38:58.380 --> 38:58.980
Magistrate Yan,

38:59.700 --> 39:01.780
we should find somewhere quieter to sit.

39:02.700 --> 39:04.020
If we keep drawing this much attention,

39:04.420 --> 39:04.940
I'm afraid

39:05.700 --> 39:06.740
it could ruin your reputation.

39:08.580 --> 39:09.820
As Your Highness wishes.

39:21.660 --> 39:28.560
(Chengfu Gate)

39:58.220 --> 39:59.180
When are you going back?

40:06.460 --> 40:07.580
Would you like to hear the truth

40:08.620 --> 40:09.380
or a lie?

40:12.900 --> 40:13.420
The truth.

40:14.860 --> 40:15.740
Princess Danyang

40:16.860 --> 40:17.740
has no need to lie.

40:19.340 --> 40:19.860
Tomorrow.

40:27.500 --> 40:33.380
(Chengfu Gate)

40:35.820 --> 40:36.180
All right.

40:38.180 --> 40:38.820
I'll see you off.

40:45.420 --> 40:46.300
I also have a lie.

40:46.940 --> 40:47.540
Would you like to hear it?

40:50.420 --> 40:50.820
All right.

40:53.100 --> 40:53.900
I'm not going back.

40:55.820 --> 40:56.980
Every day from now on,

40:57.620 --> 40:58.260
and every night,

40:59.940 --> 41:01.180
we'll stay just as we are now.

41:02.740 --> 41:03.740
Together,

41:05.020 --> 41:06.140
hand in hand,

41:07.060 --> 41:08.420
sharing the ordinary chores of life.

41:09.700 --> 41:10.380
And in the end,

41:11.020 --> 41:12.460
we'll grow old and become

41:13.380 --> 41:14.340
a couple with grey hair.

41:21.580 --> 41:21.980
All right.

41:25.260 --> 41:26.620
Tonight, is it that whatever I say,

41:27.340 --> 41:28.100
you'll agree with me?

41:36.220 --> 41:36.660
Yan Shang.

41:39.060 --> 41:40.300
Come back to Sheng'an with me.

41:49.620 --> 41:50.100
Your Highness.

41:53.500 --> 41:53.980
I...

42:00.060 --> 42:00.540
Yan Shang!

42:01.220 --> 42:01.940
Yan Shang, what's wrong?

42:02.420 --> 42:02.780
Yan Shang!

42:05.620 --> 42:06.060
Yan Shang!

42:07.140 --> 42:07.620
Yan Shang!

42:11.220 --> 42:11.700
Yan Shang!

43:56.820 --> 43:57.260
Your Highness.

43:59.860 --> 44:00.620
Tonight,

44:03.900 --> 44:04.940
you look truly beautiful.

44:08.380 --> 44:08.980
Yan Shang.

44:11.620 --> 44:12.940
You really are impossible!

44:15.100 --> 44:15.660
I'm sorry.

44:19.740 --> 44:21.380
I've kept you heartbroken for so long.

44:49.820 --> 44:53.260
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

44:53.500 --> 44:56.940
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

44:57.060 --> 45:03.980
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

45:04.140 --> 45:06.020
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

45:06.020 --> 45:08.660
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

45:08.780 --> 45:11.300
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:11.380 --> 45:15.000
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

45:15.000 --> 45:18.540
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

45:18.580 --> 45:21.980
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

45:22.020 --> 45:24.900
♪The wind blows past us♪

45:41.820 --> 45:46.540
♪- If there's still;
- Some warmth left in this world♪

45:47.180 --> 45:50.740
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:52.620 --> 45:57.420
(Next Episode Preview)

45:57.420 --> 45:58.380
I've never mistaken anyone.

45:58.740 --> 45:59.860
That is Magistrate Yan.

45:59.860 --> 46:00.900
Don't let them hear you.

46:01.100 --> 46:02.780
When we cook porridge for them later,

46:02.980 --> 46:03.540
we'll just...

46:04.140 --> 46:05.220
They clearly recognized you,

46:05.300 --> 46:06.060
yet they're still keeping it from you

46:06.620 --> 46:08.460
and plan to tamper with our food.

46:08.980 --> 46:09.900
What do you think they're planning?

46:14.201 --> 46:17.494
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

46:20.179 --> 46:25.095
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:27.289 --> 46:33.134
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:33.634 --> 46:38.860
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:41.629 --> 46:46.420
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:47.256 --> 46:53.335
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:55.136 --> 46:58.286
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:58.286 --> 46:59.934
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:59.986 --> 47:03.710
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

47:04.088 --> 47:08.754
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

47:09.373 --> 47:13.414
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

47:13.905 --> 47:16.020
♪Not a single hour less♪

47:16.060 --> 47:23.006
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:23.769 --> 47:27.222
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:27.402 --> 47:30.547
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:30.986 --> 47:37.623
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:38.020 --> 47:40.058
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:40.058 --> 47:42.534
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:42.572 --> 47:45.041
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:45.245 --> 47:52.132
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:52.444 --> 47:55.715
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:56.020 --> 47:59.193
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:59.517 --> 48:02.943
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

48:03.176 --> 48:06.401
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

48:06.732 --> 48:13.528
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

48:13.897 --> 48:15.959
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

48:15.960 --> 48:18.463
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:18.510 --> 48:20.848
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:21.079 --> 48:27.914
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:28.263 --> 48:29.881
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:30.011 --> 48:31.807
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:32.164 --> 48:35.181
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:35.221 --> 48:36.548
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
